  m_text: "Valletta has been divided into districts and patrols are in place to prevent
    any transgressors. You\u2019re going to have to sneak your way across Valletta!
    Tap on a district to move to it - but if a guard patrolling the borders between
    the districts spots you, you\u2019ll be caught, so time your moves well!\r\n"
